    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR1e0008-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_008-90a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-14T00:41:55.232+09:00">the Earl of Qǐ came to meet the funeral procession of Shū Jī in order to return it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_009-173a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-18T15:37:36.115+09:00">9.19.12 They built the outer city wall in the west.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_009-239a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-18T15:45:36.37+09:00">Wú Zǐ Yè attacked Chǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_009-241a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-18T15:47:11.484+09:00">Níng Xǐ of Wèi assassinated his lord Piāo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-7a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-19T22:43:02.726+09:00">Because the season is at its end,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-62a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">In Spring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-62a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">in the King's first month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-62a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">the Duke defeated the Qí army at Chángsháo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-62a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">No specific day is recorded</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-62a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">because it was a suspicious battle.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-62a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">When a battle is suspicious, and it is recorded as a "defeat" (for the enemy), it signifies a victory for the interior (i.e., Lǔ).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">3.10.2 In the second month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">the Duke invaded Sòng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">When there was an invasion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">why is its month recorded?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">It was because (the Duke) thereupon deepened his resentment towards Qí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">and then turned to invade Sòng, thereby increasing his enemies.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">This was condemned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-63a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">hence it was carefully recorded with the month.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">3.10.3 In the third month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">the Sòng people relocated Sù.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">"Relocated" (遷)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">is a term signifying loss.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">Its (original) land</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">was not seen again; Sù was not seen again.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">One who "relocates" (遷)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-64a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">is still one who has not yet lost their state and home (completely).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">3.10.4 In Summer,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">in the sixth month,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">the Qí army and the Sòng army halted at Láng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">"Halted" (次)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">means to stop,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-65a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">because they feared us (Lǔ).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-66a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-66a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">3.10.5 The Duke defeated the Sòng army at Chéngqiū.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-66a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">No specific day is recorded</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_003-66a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#matejkas" modified="2026-01-16T06:58:11.004+09:00">because it was a suspicious battle.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
